compliant=false — graded against `rules/rule-authoring.md`, with FOUR breaches, all four
inside the single numbered clause. The heading, the MUST NOT section, the Wiring block and
the Origin are shared with the compliant sibling and are NOT findings.

BREACH 1 — Rule 1, phrased as prohibitions, not encouragements. The clause HEADING states
an obligation ("MUST Persist Its Resume Cursor BEFORE") and the BODY hedges from the first
word to the last: "should generally aim", "are encouraged to move toward", "where that is
practical", "is usually less helpful", "tends to be worth avoiding", "may reasonably". The
closing sentence then hands back the exact case the heading forbids — the author may
persist the cursor after the batch when the job is short or the crash window is judged
small, provided a comment is written. A rule whose body returns its own forbidden case has
no contract left.

BREACH 2 — Rule 2, linguistic tripwires enumerate BLOCKED phrases verbatim. The
`**BLOCKED rationalizations:**` heading is PRESENT and holds six entries, so the slot is
filled. Every entry is an abstract category label — "Optimism about total job duration",
"Reconstruction fallacies regarding derived state", "Misplaced preference for idempotence
over recoverability". No session has ever written those words. The corpus traps nothing,
because a tripwire made of taxonomy matches no transcript.

BREACH 3 — Rule 3, every MUST clause has DO / DO NOT examples. The two arms are THE SAME
LINE. Both read `UPDATE backfill_state SET cursor = 4_210_000; process_batch(...); COMMIT;`
and they are separated only by the trailing adverbs of their comment lines, "ordering them
carefully" against "ordering them carelessly". The contrast slot is occupied and carries
no contrast; a reader cannot learn the ordering from the block, which is the one thing the
block exists to teach.

BREACH 4 — Rule 4 / § MUST NOT, rationale paragraphs longer than two sentences per
`**Why:**` line. The clause's justification runs to three long sentences and wanders past
the failure mode into batch-width tuning, how tuning drifts over a job's life, and which
downstream report first notices. The MUST NOT section's own `**Why:**` is one sentence and
is shared with the compliant pole, so only the numbered clause's justification is the
finding.

NOT FINDINGS — the shared furniture. The frontmatter with its `priority:` and `scope:`,
the title, the opening paragraph, the numbered-clause heading text, the entire `## MUST
NOT` section including its one-sentence justification, the whole Trust Posture Wiring block
with its eight canonical fields and its structurally-grounded Phase-2 signal, and the
`## Origin` paragraph are byte-identical to the compliant pole. A judge naming the deferred
detector, the fictional subject, the `priority: 10`, or the file's length has scored
furniture rather than content.

Surface equalization, MEASURED: 3733 B against the sibling's 3659 B, a ratio of 1.020; an
identical `## ` heading skeleton (MUST Rules, MUST NOT, Trust Posture Wiring, Origin); one
numbered clause each; one worked block each; two `**Why:**` lines each. The defects are all
in the CONTENT of the furniture, never in its absence — every required element is present
in both poles.
